        <mxCell id="x30" value="Rest-hours check: compares rest between two &lt;i&gt;different&lt;/i&gt; shift types — which the no-flip rule above already blocks, so in practice rest is guaranteed by “no flip”." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#666666;fontFamily=Helvetica;" parent="1" vertex="1">
